    "title": "MICROSERVICE_DEV_Bus Ticket Booking API",
    "description": "The Bus Ticket Booking API enables seamless booking of bus tickets, facilitating users in reserving seats for upcoming journeys. This API allows consumers to interact with ticketing resources by submitting booking requests, which can include various trip details such as departure and arrival locations, dates, and passenger information. Typical users include travel agencies, transportation companies, and end consumers looking to schedule their bus travel efficiently. By integrating this API, businesses can streamline ticket sales and enhance user experience in the bus transportation sector.",
